  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThere is a [proposal](https://github.com/Igalia/webengineshackfest/issues/80) for an extraordinary WHATNOT meeting to be held during the [Web Engines Hackfest](https://webengineshackfest.org/) in June. As this will be at least partly a F2F if there's specific issues you'd like to discuss it's worth commenting them on here to form an agenda.\n\nI will update this issue once we have a specific date and time set.",
